From b75025072ce8ed4602b8b4bbe3149c69c8e2aa29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cosmin Tanislav <demonsingur@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:41:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 19/23] arm64: defconfig: disable deprecated MAX96712 driver
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260930-gmsl2-3_serdes-v18-0-43117818f499@analog.com]

The staging MAX96712 driver will be removed as its functionality has
been moved to the MAX96724 driver which makes use of the Maxim
GMSL2/3 deserializer framework.

Signed-off-by: Cosmin Tanislav <demonsingur@gmail.com>
Tested-by: Martin Hecht <mhecht73@gmail.com>
Tested-by: Tomi Valkeinen <tomi.valkeinen@ideasonboard.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 83496e2..8a47b0d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1317,7 +1317,6 @@ CONFIG_GREYBUS=m
 CONFIG_GREYBUS_BEAGLEPLAY=m
 CONFIG_STAGING=y
 CONFIG_STAGING_MEDIA=y
-CONFIG_VIDEO_MAX96712=m
 CONFIG_VIDEO_MESON_VDEC=m
 CONFIG_SND_BCM2835=m
 CONFIG_CHROME_PLATFORMS=y
